CORE buechi
buechi_transition_constraint1.sv
--buechi --new-ic3
^\[main\.p\] .*: UNSUPPORTED: transition constraints not supported by new IC3 engine$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^\[main\.p\] .*: REFUTED$
--
The new IC3 engine assumes that the transition relation is given by the
next-state functions of the latches. With a transition constraint, it
reported a spurious counterexample for p, which holds (word-level BMC,
k-induction and BDDs with --buechi prove it).
